, \\\"--force\\\", \\\"--\\\", \\\"SLOW do it\\\", ...]\\n```\\n\\nI restored `src/cli.rs` and the suite passes again.\\n\\nThe first swapped run reported a different line, `cli_e2e.rs:110`, with an `assertion left == right [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":51,"content":"{\"duration_api_ms\":184937,\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"session_id\":\"8a3efb08-3f9d-42fc-94c5-f574b1ccde60\",\"total_cost_usd\":0.8993224000000001,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":16,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":8475,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":735589,\"output_tokens\":5761,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":1088},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":8475,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"iterations\":[{\"input_tokens\":2,\"output_tokens\":1066,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":95258,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":852,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":852},\"type\":\"message\"}],\"speed\":\"standard\",\"fallback_credit\":null},\"modelUsage\":{\"claude-sonnet-5-5\":{\"inputTokens\":46,\"outputTokens\":22864,\"thinkingTokens\":6636,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":1669372,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":84179,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.8993224000000001,\"contextWindow\":1 [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/ponytail-20.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":40,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_55850322-f0ce-4239-8f83-05d067fdb5d\",\"tool_call\":{\"grepToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"pattern\":\"StatusRecordWriter\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-7-tracer\",\"caseInsensitive\":false,\"multiline\":false,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_55850322-f0ce-4239-8f83-05d067fdb5d\",\"offset\":0},\"result\":{\"success\":{\"pattern\":\"StatusRec