directory\"}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":19,"content":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cfb9FEDomPHQvA7nYhrvu\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I haven't renamed anything, because I don't know which name you prefer. Nothing in the repo or my memory says, and I won't guess.\\n\\n`calc.py` has one function, `add(a, b)`. `test_calc.py` imports and calls it, so I'd update the test along with the rename.\\n\\n`add` also returns `a - b`, so `test_calc.py` would fail today. Tell me if you want that fixed too. I haven't touched it.\\n\\nWhat name do you want?\\n\\nSTATUS: NEEDS_CONTEXT\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":229,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":26274,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":229},\"output_tokens\":166,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":nul [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":20,"content":"{\"duration_api_ms\":13567,\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"session_id\":\"340cbc2c-a92e-48ad-b21e-2a1933dd06f5\",\"total_cost_usd\":0.0784728,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":6,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":14519,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":63824,\"output_tokens\":762,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":60},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":14519,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"iterations\":[{\"input_tokens\":2,\"output_tokens\":166,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":26274,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":229,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0