 \"A postcondition command the TOOL runs after the agent. A failing gate downgrades DONE to DONE_WITH_CONCERNS.\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":99,"content":"            \"idleMs\": {","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":101,"content":"                \"description\": \"Override the idle watchdog window applied while NO tool call is in flight (i.e. waiting on the model itself) — a silence here is a real hang signal. null disables it for this job. Defaults to the server profile's idleMs (currently 300000ms / 5min). You usually don't need this: a running tool call uses the separate, wider toolIdleMs window automatically.\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":105,"content":"                \"description\": \"Override the idle watchdog window applied while a tool call IS in flight (e.g. a shell command, build, or test suite) — this can legitimately go silent for a long time, so it defaults much wider than idleMs. null disables the watchdog for in-flight tool calls on this job. Defaults to the server profile's toolIdleMs (currently 1800000ms / 30min).\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":156,"content":"                \"description\": \"Orchestrator answer to the delegated agent's question (becomes the resume prompt).\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":165,"content":"                \"Delegate a coding/research task to a Cursor model via the local cursor-agent CLI. \\","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":166,"content":"Fast tasks return a full RunOutput (status, text, usage, cost, git change-set, gate result). \\","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":202,"content":"(isolation, capability, verifyCommands, gate, model), then continue via \\","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":210,"content":"            description: \"Diagnose cursor-delegate setup: plugin version, cursor-agent binary + --version, \\","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./src/status_record.rs","matches":[{"lineNumber":12,"content":"        .join(\"cursor-delegate-jobs\")","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./src/runner/tests.rs","matches":[{"lineNumber":56,"content":"            gate: Some(\"make ci\".into()),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":157,"content":"    assert_eq!(spec.gate, \"make ci\");","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":401,"content":"fn per_call_gate_and_verify() {","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":406,"content":"            gate: Some(\"custom-gate\".into()),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":209,"totalMatchedLines":209,"clientTruncated":true,"ripgrepTruncated":false,"headLimitApplied":40}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_502bf920-4245-4865-b6a4-286edf7ea16","startedAtMs":"1790845478721","completedAtMs":"1790845479125"},"model_call_id":"a380c011-da4d-41b0-b1f6-64024bf8ce86-5-3mg0","session_id":"d0cbbbf5-5deb-40e3-a6cf-fb1778573e0a","timestamp_ms":1790845479108}
